{"file_name": "Untitled design (7).png", "id": "760533521614935", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001703_760533524948268_5929132528678025364_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oJ0IXBCre6EQ7kNvwEv0gBw&_nc_oc=AdoBcvPag7G5x2YMYEc4EwAZmCX_Uxr9JxP8nCMK2x39jBzmnGlAibZcAblbe9PZpyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af39eFoibck_tBr9s2ERbiu_wXxH7n8vuxNTPuroHe0ImA&oe=69D9078E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "THE RETRIEVAL (2).png", "id": "1059497764697325", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982500_1059497768030658_269254459267951193_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N1-heCO38swQ7kNvwGPFG6x&_nc_oc=AdokwhshQN9XaVxJSx0flqUS_v6qbPBdbcRSa7G8t2PD1A2inE3zjDDQgKhlLgkrE2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2pyGq981n_fEw_nSRpPR-EPuuUzCnQklLS_Urck6eMKA&oe=69D8F113"}, "display_name": "The Retrieval", "keywords": [], "long_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taking place in the far future. Navigate your way through abandoned spaceship learning what happened to the crew.\n\n If you enjoy puzzles games and mind bending horror environments - this game is for you. And remember, the deep space can play tricks to the mind..\n\nWarning: this game contains sudden horrifying moments.\n\nThis game will receive regular updates.", "short_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taki